  title   = {Effect Systems as Abstract Interpretations},
  journal = {arXiv preprint arXiv:2606.19686},
  year    = 2026,
  note    = {Embeds Gordon's EFFECT QUANTALE (carrier + a join for branching + a partial monoid for
             sequencing, Def 2.1, with the two distribution laws) as an abstract domain over
             event-occurrence traces. Classifies bang as the DEGENERATE commutative-total effect quantale
             (sequence = join: order-insensitive Finset effects; the easy corner, no MacNeille completion).
             Load-bearing structural fact for the GRADED design: effect IDEMPOTENCE (phi-join-phi = phi)
             DECOUPLES the effect and grade axes, so the letC product is direct (independent), NOT reduced
             -- which keeps the quantitative calculation tractable; ordered effects (sequence != join)
             would re-couple them via the Sec 6 iteration operator. Does SOUNDNESS, not DERIVATION (the
             SbC complement); names continuation answer-type effect/type mutual-dependency as the hard
             open case (adjacent to the #35 grade-the-resumption crux). Raises the abstract-interpretation
             / logical-soundness (Timany 2024) intersection as open -- where bang sits.
             \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.19686}},
}

